    fix: promote planar BSpline to Plane in intersect_edge_face
    
    The E-F intersection dispatch was missing the planar BSpline → Plane
    promotion that F-F intersection already had (pave_filler.rs:1555).
    Without this, every edge×face pair on a planar-BSpline face fell through
    to the slow numeric fallback (intersect_edge_face_numeric) instead of
    the fast analytic Line×Plane dispatch, making boolean operations on
    nurbsconvert'ed boxes extremely slow (>60s per case).
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>

